DESCRIPTION:A comic. A mic. A brick wall. A room full of fans. It doesn’t
  get more New York than this. Tucked into the Upper West Side just minutes 
 from Times Square\, our club channels the raw energy of classic stand-up—
 every show is a showcase of multiple comics—from surprise drop-ins to lau
 gh-out-loud regulars. It’s where comedy lovers come for the real thing.\n
